sequenceDiagram
  participant App as L7 Caller
  participant Host as Host Rust
  participant Peer as Peer Rust

  Host->>Host: mint Cap
  Host-->>App: Cap
  App->>Host: submit Intent + Cap
  Host->>Host: verify → once → truth → dispatch
  Host->>Host: lineage → project
  Host-->>App: Result Ops
  App->>Peer: apply Result
  Peer->>Peer: apply Ops in order
  Peer-->>Host: optional receipt
  App->>Host: end Activity
  Host->>Host: reverse landed or authorized
